OL,3,GNEWSAFrom Amazon retreats to clinical
OL,4,Aresearch: The rise of psychedelic
OL,5,Atherapy
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrom retreats in the Amazon to clinical
OL,8,Ftrials in Newcastle, psychedelic
OL,9,Ftherapy is attracting growing attention
OL,10,Fas a possible treatment for depression.
OL,11,FCould hallucinogenic drugs one day
OL,12,Fbecome part of mainstream NHS care?
OL,14,FClaire Torpey had tried traditional
OL,15,Fforms of mental health support,
OL,16,Fincluding counselling. But she says
OL,17,Fthere was still something she could not
OL,18,Fshake.
OL,20,F"There was a deep sadness. I was living
OL,21,Fin chronic anxiety," she says.
