OL,6,
OL,7,FClaire, from Tynemouth, North Tyneside,
OL,8,Fspent part of her childhood in care and
OL,9,Fsays the challenges she faced growing
OL,10,Fup were compounded by the deaths of her
OL,11,Ffather and grandmother in consecutive
OL,12,Fyears.
